# Blocking call between Enter/Acquire/EnterCriticalSection/TMonitor.Enter and the matching Leave.
wait-while-holding-lock 19
wait-while-holding-lock 27
wait-while-holding-lock 37
wait-while-holding-lock 46
# Leave of a DIFFERENT lock object does not release GLock: still held, still flagged.
wait-while-holding-lock 54
# After Leave / before Enter: not held.
!wait-while-holding-lock 66
!wait-while-holding-lock 71
# Sleep inside a nested routine runs under its own (empty) lock state.
!wait-while-holding-lock 79
